``` HL-0002 - LSASS Credential Dumping (ATT&CK T1003.001; related T1218.011) ```
``` Platform: Splunk. Sources: Sysmon EventCode 1 and/or Windows Security EventCode 4688 (command-line auditing required) ```
``` Playbook: playbooks/HL-0002-T1003.001-lsass-credential-dumping.md ```
``` Adjust index/sourcetype and field names to match your Windows TA / CIM mapping ```
``` Lab dataset: use earliest=0 ```
index=windows (EventCode=1 OR EventCode=4688) earliest=-14d
| eval proc=lower(coalesce(Image, New_Process_Name, NewProcessName)),
       cmd=coalesce(CommandLine, Process_Command_Line),
       parent=lower(coalesce(ParentImage, Creator_Process_Name, ParentProcessName)),
       acct=coalesce(User, Account_Name, user),
       ofn=lower(coalesce(OriginalFileName, "-")),
       dest=coalesce(Computer, ComputerName, host)
| where match(cmd, "(?i)(comsvcs|lsass)")
| eval m_comsvcs=if(match(cmd, "(?i)comsvcs") AND match(cmd, "(?i)(minidump|#24)"), 1, 0),
       m_procdump=if(match(cmd, "(?i)\s(-ma|/ma|-mm|-mp)\s") AND match(cmd, "(?i)lsass"), 1, 0),
       m_generic=if(match(cmd, "(?i)lsass") AND match(cmd, "(?i)\.dmp"), 1, 0)
| where m_comsvcs=1 OR m_procdump=1 OR m_generic=1
| eval dump_method=case(m_comsvcs=1, "comsvcs MiniDump", m_procdump=1, "ProcDump-style flags", true(), "lsass + .dmp (generic)")
``` comsvcs often targets LSASS by PID only: resolve it on the host (playbook step 3) ```
| rex field=cmd "(?i)(minidump|#24)[\s,]+(?<target_pid>\d+)"
| rex field=cmd "(?i)(?<dump_file>\S+\.dmp)\b"
``` Renamed tool: on-disk image name differs from the PE original file name (Sysmon only) ```
| eval image_name=mvindex(split(proc, "\\"), -1),
       renamed=if(ofn!="-" AND image_name!=ofn AND image_name!=ofn.".exe", 1, 0)
| fillnull value="-" target_pid dump_file parent acct
| stats count AS hits dc(dest) AS hosts min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen
        values(dest) AS host_list values(cmd) AS sample_cmds values(target_pid) AS target_pids
        values(dump_file) AS dump_files values(proc) AS image_paths
        BY dump_method image_name ofn renamed parent acct
| eval host_list=mvindex(host_list, 0, 24), sample_cmds=mvindex(sample_cmds, 0, 4)
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
``` Rare tool/parent/account combinations first ```
| sort 0 hits hosts
``` ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ```
``` Optional second search (run separately): Sysmon EID 10 handle access to LSASS. ```
``` Catches dumpers that never put lsass on a command line. Example: ```
```   index=windows EventCode=10 TargetImage="*\\lsass.exe" earliest=-14d ```
```   (GrantedAccess=0x1010 OR GrantedAccess=0x1410 OR GrantedAccess=0x1fffff) ```
```   | stats count AS hits dc(Computer) AS hosts values(Computer) AS host_list BY SourceImage GrantedAccess SourceUser ```
```   | sort 0 hits hosts ```
``` Expect noise from AV/EDR and system processes; stack and baseline before alerting. ```
